{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31748","headline":"投孟郊 · 贾岛","name":"投孟郊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月中有孤芳，天下聆薰风。\n江南有高唱，海北初来通。\n容飘清冷余，自蕴襟抱中。\n止息乃流溢，推寻却冥蒙。\n我知雪山子，谒彼偈句空。\n必竟获所实，尔焉遂深衷。\n录之孤灯前，犹恨百首终。\n一吟动狂机，万疾辞顽躬。\n生平面未交，永夕梦辄同。\n叙诘谁君师，讵言无吾宗。\n余求履其迹，君曰可但攻。\n啜波肠易饱，揖险神难从。\n前岁曾入洛，差池阻从龙。\n萍家复从赵，云思长萦萦。\n嵩海每可诣，长途追再穷。\n愿倾肺肠事，尽入焦梧桐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}